     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Since we are moving the authorization checks into the HTTP layer, would it make sense to adapt the PrincipalProviders to be servlet filters? We also need to determine how Shiro translates servlet user principals to its PrinicpalCollection, and when it happens.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": " ",
